eamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694540","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4327690-1846651706683962","game_id":"steam-4327690","kind":"announcement","title":"Summer Blue — Steam Store Page Now Live!","summary":"An unexpected twist of fate brings you to a small island that has slowly fallen into decline.All you wanted was a peaceful summer away from the hustle and bustle of city life. But your arrival may be the turning point that changes the island's fate.Meet four beautiful girls, bring this long-forgotten island back to life, and write your own summer romance!✦ Gameplay➤ Earn money and run local businesses to bring the island back to life!From cleaning rooms at the inn and mixing drinks at the bar to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T07:04:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683962","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4327690-1846018067925450","game_id":"steam-4327690","kind":"announcement","title":"《How to Train Your Spirit: The Exorcism of a Busty Ghost》Demo Now Available!","summary":"Only through a special “Taming Ritual” can you gradually unravel her lingering obsession and help the bound spirit finally find peace.-In the game, you’ll encounter a busty bound spirit who refuses to leave this world. Through special interactions, you’ll gradually uncover what lies within her heart and discover the reason she remains trapped here.▼ Promotional Anime PV on YouTube✨ Demo Features・Experience the opening chapters of the story・Experience the core gameplay・Unlock outfit customization","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T09:01:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externa